{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>[Let\u2019s Play / Streaming is Welcome]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>UNION SURVIVORS</i> is open to everyone for Let's Play videos and livestreaming.<br>No permission is required to stream or record gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We\u2019d greatly appreciate it if you could leave a review on Steam or share your thoughts on our official Discord!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>[About the Demo Version]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the demo version, you can play by selecting a limited number of stages and characters.<br>Please note that some features are locked and differ from the full version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What is \u201cUNION SURVIVORS\u201d?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864030/extras/963abcbd469002a539bb9142bb2ec5b8.poster.avif?t=1753418931\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864030/extras/963abcbd469002a539bb9142bb2ec5b8.webm?t=1753418931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864030/extras/963abcbd469002a539bb9142bb2ec5b8.mp4?t=1753418931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;UNION SURVIVORS&quot; is a roguelite mining survival game that supports online cooperative play for up to 4 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players dig through slime-filled terrain to carve their paths and defeat hordes of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The Possibilities for Character Development Are Endless</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864030/extras/7b6e02783c132c0d8b01552ebc609e6e.poster.avif?t=1753418931\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864030/extras/7b6e02783c132c0d8b01552ebc609e6e.webm?t=1753418931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864030/extras/7b6e02783c132c0d8b01552ebc609e6e.mp4?t=1753418931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players defeat enemies and choose from a variety of level-up options to enhance their characters' abilities.  <br>As characters level up, new weapons are unlocked, further strengthening their combat power.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each weapon and level-up choice influences the build, making every challenge a unique experience and ensuring no two playthroughs are alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Mine Resources And Race Across The Field!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864030/extras/3c45a9578d77f70f4d45ad33cf134ef4.poster.avif?t=1753418931\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864030/extras/3c45a9578d77f70f4d45ad33cf134ef4.webm?t=1753418931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864030/extras/3c45a9578d77f70f4d45ad33cf134ef4.mp4?t=1753418931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Slimes blocking the path may contain essential resources needed to strengthen characters or provide healing items. <br>Instead of always taking the safest route, players are encouraged to forge their own paths and face challenges head-on.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3864030?t=1753418931","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864030/fdd05548bd335bd0e841a1930de527cb788ee3fd/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753418931","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864030/54255317e96c4bf5992792696528fa6585b51505/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753418931","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864030/54255317e96c4bf5992792696528fa6585b51505/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753418931","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>[Let\u2019s Play / Streaming is Welcome]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>UNION SURVIVORS</i> is open to everyone for Let's Play videos and livestreaming.<br>No permission is required to stream or record gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We\u2019d greatly appreciate it if you could leave a review on Steam or share your thoughts on our official Discord!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>[About the Demo Version]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the demo version, you can play by selecting a limited number of stages and characters.<br>Please note that some features are locked and differ from the full version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What is \u201cUNION SURVIVORS\u201d?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://s