laythroughs are alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Mine Resources And Race Across The Field!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864030/extras/3c45a9578d77f70f4d45ad33cf134ef4.poster.avif?t=1753418931\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864030/extras/3c45a9578d77f70f4d45ad33cf134ef4.webm?t=1753418931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864030/extras/3c45a9578d77f70f4d45ad33cf134ef4.mp4?t=1753418931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Slimes blocking the path may contain essential resources needed to strengthen characters or provide healing items. <br>Instead of always taking the safest route, players are encouraged to forge their own paths and face challenges head-on.</p>","developers":["MUC GAMES"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3178030","name":"UNION SURVIVORS"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864030/e38f091ec4265025d755d2b1d6763de5d65c6549/header.jpg?t=1753418931","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257173319,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257173319/movie480.mp4?t=1753414078","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257173319/movie_max.mp4?t=1753414078"},"name":"Official Demo Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257173319/9c76657d96721a89f8079e7e62882f12a9bffbe0/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1753414078","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store